---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Mohammed Fawaz — About">
  <header class="masthead">
    <h1>MOHAMMED FAWAZ</h1>
    <p>Robotics and Automation Engineering</p>
  </header>

  <section class="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <h2 id="about-heading">About Me</h2>
    <p>
      I am a final-year Robotics and Automation Engineering student at Sahyadri College
      of Engineering &amp; Management, affiliated with Visvesvaraya Technological University.
      My work focuses on building robotic systems that bring mechanical design, embedded
      control, and computer vision together.
    </p>
    <p>
      During my R&amp;D internship at AIRAT Systems LLP, I worked on a desktop animatronic
      robot and the ArecaSort V1 grading machine. My responsibilities included CAD design
      and prototype assembly, preparing image datasets, and integrating control software
      with the hardware. For the animatronic robot, I redesigned the enclosure and servo
      mounts, supported the migration from Raspberry Pi to NVIDIA Jetson, and developed
      Python software to run face tracking, speech processing, and servo control concurrently.
    </p>
    <p>
      I also led a student team developing an automated fish sorting and grading system.
      I handled the SolidWorks assembly model and coordinated fabrication, then worked on
      the YOLOv8 detection model and Raspberry Pi integration. My other projects cover
      mobile robot navigation, line-following control, manipulator kinematics, and finite
      element analysis of mechanical components.
    </p>
    <p>
      I am interested in robotics, automation, and R&amp;D roles where I can contribute to
      mechanical development and system integration. I enjoy the detailed work of checking
      component fit, tuning control behaviour, and tracing faults between software and hardware.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="about" aria-labelledby="skills-heading">
    <h2 id="skills-heading">Technical Experience</h2>
    <dl>
      <div><dt>Mechanical design</dt><dd>SolidWorks and Fusion 360 for parts, assemblies, enclosures, and fabrication. FDM printing and prototype assembly.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Embedded systems</dt><dd>Arduino, Raspberry Pi, and NVIDIA Jetson. Python and C/C++ control software, sensor integration, and I2C servo control.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Computer vision</dt><dd>OpenCV, YOLOv8 and YOLOv10, dataset annotation, model evaluation, and TensorRT deployment.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Simulation and analysis</dt><dd>ROS and Gazebo for navigation studies, CoppeliaSim for control development, MATLAB and RoboAnalyzer for kinematics, and ANSYS Workbench for stress analysis.</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <a class="project-link" href="/projects">View engineering projects →</a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .masthead { border: 2px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.5rem 2rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .masthead h1 { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 1.8rem; margin: 0 0 0.3rem; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .masthead p { margin: 0; color: var(--line); }
  .about { border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  h2 { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; }
  .about p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .about p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  dl { margin: 0; }
  dl div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 170px) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 1rem; padding: 1rem 0; border-top: 1px dashed var(--line); }
  dt { font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); }
  dd { margin: 0; }
  .project-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--line-bright); text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .project-link:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  .project-link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { dl div { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 0.3rem; } }
</style>
